sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 前端
    participant G as Gateway
    participant V as Video RPC
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant OSS as 对象存储

    U->>G: 计算 file_hash（前端 SHA256 or MD5）
    U->>G: /video/upload/init { file_hash }
    G->>V: 查询 file_assets WHERE file_hash=?

    alt 已存在（秒传命中）
        V->>DB: BEGIN
        V->>DB: file_assets.ref_count += 1
        V->>DB: COMMIT
        V-->>G: { existed:true, url }
        G-->>U: 秒传成功
    else 需要真实上传
        V-->>G: 生成上传 token
        G-->>U: 上传 URL
        U->>OSS: 分片上传
        U->>G: /video/upload/complete
        G->>V: BEGIN → INSERT file_assets(ref_count=1) → COMMIT
    end

    U->>G: /video/publish { file_asset_id, title, tags, request_id }
    G->>V: PublishVideo
    V->>DB: BEGIN
    V->>DB: INSERT videos + INSERT video_tags
    V->>DB: INSERT outbox_events(feed.video.events, published)
    V->>DB: COMMIT
    V-->>G: VideoInfo
